  "body_html": "<p>As mentioned last week, we discussed adding positions (or adding to current positions) should they start performing. <strong>We are seeing that.</strong> We are also seeing a wide array of stocks up a healthy amount pre-market. The volatility index, VIX also came below 22…in fact, it gapped down, currently at 20.08. Could all of this change in a moment? Could a tweet come out and reverse everything negatively? Absolutely, hence why we focus more on risk management than on profits. Profits come in time. The market has been difficult, but we are up for the year. The patience has paid off and looking at various charts and signals, <em><strong>this is the time to act… </strong></em></p><p>If you have questions, feel free to <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/39f61668-99f5-4030-aa0d-6245eabf5a1d\">ask in the chat</a>!</p><p>👇 4 Stocks I am picking up today, 3 of which we have traded successfully before: 👇</p><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p><strong>Grindr - GRND - $24.03</strong></p><ul><li><p>We just recently traded this company. Personally I took profit before earnings…earnings are a coin toss. The stock plummeted at earnings, however it has forced its way back up near the local high again. <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/after-32-days-of-waitingwe-have-some\">We bought Grindr bac on April 23<sup>rd</sup></a>, and its performed beautifully. You can see that post for more information.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W4GR!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3c127f17-535b-4a34-ae20-f45aafdef54c_1216x784.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W4GR!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_au